WEBVTT

00:29:27.807 --> 00:29:32.296
one piece of feedback
about what you saw worked

00:29:32.320 --> 00:29:35.286
in building a high-quality
connection to you."

00:29:35.310 --> 00:29:38.175
And then -- boom! --
again, the energy just goes

00:29:38.199 --> 00:29:43.859
because we rarely get feedback
about how little things that we do

00:29:43.883 --> 00:29:48.164
actually affect someone's
sense of connection with you.

00:29:48.188 --> 00:29:51.009
AG: Getting that positive feedback
about what you did well

00:29:51.033 --> 00:29:52.876
is a helpful intervention in itself.

00:29:52.900 --> 00:29:54.642
I do this exercise in the classroom,

00:29:54.666 --> 00:29:56.586
and it's always a hit with students.

00:29:56.610 --> 00:29:58.303
They're often surprised to discover

00:29:58.327 --> 00:30:00.433
that they already have
some intuitive skills